  "description": "Bundle of 20 unique Cute Christmas Stud Earrings – ready for laser cutting machines!\nHere you will find lots of different adorable critters, such as winter birds, Christmas sweets and even Turtles 🙂\n– hand drawn designs\n– unique gift idea for Christmas\n– Cute style\n– suitable for every day wear\n– You can cut them from wood, acryl or other suitable material, and play with colors\n– You can also make keychains, pendants, decor and much more!\nYou will receive:\n20 AI (Adobe Illustrator)\n20 SVG\n20 PNG ( 300dpi – Transparent )\n20 EPS\n20 DXF\nAlso includes colored SVG files\n– Watermark is NOT going to be included on purchased files\n– Image file is 300dpi – 900 x 900px\n– Size of a document for SVG, DXF, EPS, AI – 1.5 x 2″\n– This is a digital download item, NOT a physical one\nThe icons of SVG files on some computers might have an appearance of internet browser (HTML). It’s something that new Windows simply does. However it’s only the icon look, so no worries, they are SVG files that can be opened and will work with all SVG supporting apps, softwares and machines.\nIf you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.\nHappy crafting!\n© 2019.Ivy’sCreativityHouse all rights reserved",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bundle of 20 unique Cute Christmas Stud Earrings – ready for laser cutting machines!</p>\n<p>Here you will find lots of different adorable critters, such as winter birds, Christmas sweets and even Turtles 🙂</p>\n<p>– hand drawn designs<br>\n– unique gift idea for Christmas<br>\n– Cute style<br>\n– suitable for every day wear</p>\n<p>– You can cut them from wood, acryl or other suitable material, and play with colors<br>\n– You can also make keychains, pendants, decor and much more!</p>\n<p>You will receive:</p>\n<p>20 AI (Adobe Illustrator)<br>\n20 SVG<br>\n20 PNG ( 300dpi – Transparent )<br>\n20 EPS<br>\n20 DXF</p>\n<p>Also includes colored SVG files</p>\n<p>– Watermark is NOT going to be included on purchased files<br>\n– Image file is 300dpi – 900 x 900px<br>\n– Size of a document for SVG, DXF, EPS, AI – 1.5 x 2″<br>\n– This is a digital download item, NOT a physical one</p>\n<p>The icons of SVG files on some computers might have an appearance of internet browser (HTML). It’s something that new Windows simply does. However it’s only the icon look, so no worries, they are SVG files that can be opened and will work with all SVG supporting apps, softwares and machines.</p>\n<p>If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.</p>\n<p>Happy crafting!</p>\n<p>© 2019.Ivy’sCreativityHouse all rights reserved</p>",
